- description: This project's JavaScript suite - security-and-quality, security-experimental and code-quality-extended in full, with js/untrusted-data-to-external-api-more-sources swapped for a locally re-modelled copy of the exact same query (see lu77u-js-models/SafeReactHooks.qll for why and what changed) rather than left out. Every other query, and every other package that query can still flag, is unchanged.
- apply: codeql-suites/javascript-security-and-quality.qls
  from: codeql/javascript-queries
- apply: codeql-suites/javascript-security-experimental.qls
  from: codeql/javascript-queries
- apply: codeql-suites/javascript-code-quality-extended.qls
  from: codeql/javascript-queries
- exclude:
    id:
      - js/untrusted-data-to-external-api-more-sources
- query: UntrustedDataToExternalAPIMoreSources.ql
  from: lu77u/js-models
